{"title":"Briarling","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 43 Briar that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/briarling\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/briarling?lv=42\">Lv 42 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/briarling?lv=43\">Lv 43 <span>5</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/briarling\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>42</b></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td>2</td><td>in the wilds around 1691, 1551</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/briarling?lv=43\" title=\"Pick level 43\"><td><b>43</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>222</td><td>28.2</td><td>2,150</td><td class=\"muted\">666 · 39.5 · 6,450</td><td>5</td><td>in the wilds around 1621, 1579</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"briarling\" data-map-level=\"42\">Show level 42 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-537.7px,-2590.5px)\"><img src=\"tiles/4/1/9.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:2304px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/1/10.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:2560px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/2/9.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:2304px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/2/10.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:2560px\"><i style=\"left:670.0px;top:2618.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:576.6px;top:2608.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:521.2px;top:2579.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:537.5px;top:2593.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:509.0px;top:2578.5px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 1621, 1579 <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1691, 1551 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"briarling\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Briar: <a href=\"#/monster/briar-warden\">Briar Warden</a> <span class=\"muted\">(46)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/elder-briar-warden\">Elder Briar Warden</a> <span class=\"muted\">(49)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/459d2dd350c89abe5e38.webp\" alt=\"Briarling\"></div><h3>Briarling</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>42</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 43)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Briar</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>212</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>27.6</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,100</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>6 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}